@WeakAppWrapper.WebApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5012

### Health
GET {{WeakAppWrapper.WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

### Filtered and paginated readings
GET {{WeakAppWrapper.WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/readings?type=air_quality&metricKey=co2&minValue=400&page=1&pageSize=20&sortBy=capturedAt&sortDirection=desc
Accept: application/json

### Latest readings
GET {{WeakAppWrapper.WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/readings/latest?source=weakapp
Accept: application/json

### Aggregations by location
GET {{WeakAppWrapper.WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/aggregations/by-location?metricKey=co2
Accept: application/json

### Aggregations by type
GET {{WeakAppWrapper.WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/aggregations/by-type
Accept: application/json

### Aggregations by time
GET {{WeakAppWrapper.WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/aggregations/by-time?bucket=hour&metricKey=co2
Accept: application/json

### GraphQL readings
POST {{WeakAppWrapper.WebApi_HostAddress}}/graphql
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "query { readings(page: 1, pageSize: 5) { totalCount items { id source type name capturedAt } } }"
}

###
